      "name": "the-candidate-set-is-the-content-s-own-names-in-attempt-order",
      "rationale": "Soft patching has no directory of its own: RetroArch composes four names from the content path with its last extension stripped and tries them ips -> bps -> ups -> xdelta, each with nine indexed continuations on top. On RetroDECK the shipped binary was read for its compile-time flags, so every candidate states that this build attempts it.",
